{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/seamsegway.gif?t=1747400686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to manage 5 stores simultaneously in a shopping mall? Can you keep the mall's quality index maximally positive for as long as possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't just a simple management simulator! Here, you'll need to tackle challenges and ensure that everything is running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor store decor, restroom supply levels, and the stock levels of vending machines. Keep an eye on when you can hire employees who can greatly assist in your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for thieves in the stores \u2013 they can steal valuable products if you're not vigilant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also take out a loan from a loan shark, but <strong>BE CAREFUL.</strong>.. if you don't pay it back on time, they'll raid your store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you love fantastically cool-looking characters? If you open the Game Shop, you can own them all and sell them for a high price to earn as much money as possible \u2013 even enough to buy the most expensive one!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/parking.jpg?t=1747400686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/MallManager_Separator.png?t=1747400686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full control at your fingertips</strong>: Manage your entire mall through a modern tablet interface! Use various apps to track your revenue, expenses, and handle essential management tasks with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanding store network</strong>: Start with a simple store and grow your mall by unlocking and opening more stores! Each store has its own development levels, unlocking new products and furnishings as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic pricing and customer reactions</strong>: Set the right price for your products and watch how your customers react. If your prices are too high, they'll walk away, but if you find the right balance, your profits will soar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advertising revenue and vending machines</strong>: Set up billboards and place various vending machines throughout the mall. The more visitors you attract, the higher your advertising revenue and sales will be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/mall_managergame.gif?t=1747400686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic quality index</strong>: Boost your mall's appeal with decorative elements like plants and benches to increase foot traffic and customer satisfaction. Every detail contributes to the success of your shopping center!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Staff management</strong>: Hire sales assistants, cleaners, and vending machine refillers! Upgrade your staff's abilities to make them more efficient and faster in handling their tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Comprehensive financial analysis</strong>: Monitor your mall\u2019s financial status with the central diagram. Review daily income and expenses to ensure you\u2019re making the best strategic decisions for growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging levels and activities</strong>: Complete a variety of tasks and reach new levels to unlock exciting new features. Open new stores, install more billboards, and upgrade the mall\u2019s infrastructure to keep your visitors coming back for more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/mallmanagertable.gif?t=1747400686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why should you play Mall Manager Simulator?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mall Manager Simulator is a rich and engaging management game that challenges your strategic thinking. Step by step, you\u2019ll develop your mall, with every decision you make shaping the future of your shopping empire. Can you become the most successful mall manager and build the city's greatest shopping destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the challenge and transform your mall into a shopping paradise! Download Mall Manager Simulator now and start your journey toward becoming the best mall manager in town!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"$ 8000 Revenue in Electronic Store!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/76694470dd202f864c70b7b6c400e61b09c6edfd.jpg"},{"name":"You have opened your third store!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/8c9592ee0f96b1a02c4d8a7c131fbf76a78611a9.jpg"},{"name":"You have reached $80,000 in revenue across three stores!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/65cc3af703415b3c8841ac1acaa522d17c44b421.jpg"},{"name":"Your quality index was 100% for 2 days!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/67740d0bb036f5fe2bf2c48624d7b2f4c70f2a9f.jpg"},{"name":"You have opened your fifth store!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/725f9ec7f246dcc8ed530a0d66d98e2d88356016.jpg"},{"name":"You have sold your 5000th product!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/fcf1754a81226e2121f1552928db567fc41929ac.jpg"},{"name":"Your quality index was 100% for 15 days!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/2475d14932f68f32f00739f5ebd6098cd2c6bf32.jpg"},{"name":"You have hired your 22nd employee!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/7487ff015e91a528e12d6ebe9ce5f77f1f524dd7.jpg"},{"name":"Quality index at 100% for 20 days! $300,000 in revenue!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3092980/17e67a90c5d552ed07fa9492a0d3e3d58792e43e.jpg"}],"total":9},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3092980?t=1747400686","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1747400686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/e18fe929eb295f1eb3358eda5f9803d2166eb257/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747400686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/e18fe929eb295f1eb3358eda5f9803d2166eb257/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747400686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3225330,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/seamsegway.gif?t=1747400686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you ready to manage 5 stores simultaneously in a shopping mall? Can you keep the mall's quality index maximally positive for as long as possible?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This isn't just a simple management simulator! Here, you'll need to tackle challenges and ensure that everything is running smoothly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Monitor store decor, restroom supply levels, and the stock levels of vending machines. Keep an eye on when you can hire employees who can greatly assist in your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Watch out for thieves in the stores \u2013 they can steal valuable products if you're not vigilant.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also take out a loan from a loan shark, but <strong>BE CAREFUL.</strong>.. if you don't pay it back on time, they'll raid your store!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do you love fantastically cool-looking characters? If you open the Game Shop, you can own them all and sell them for a high price to earn as much money as possible \u2013 even enough to buy the most expensive one!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/parking.jpg?t=1747400686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/MallManager_Separator.png?t=1747400686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full control at your fingertips</strong>: Manage your entire mall through a modern tablet interface! Use various apps to track your revenue, expenses, and handle essential management tasks with ease.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Expanding store network</strong>: Start with a simple store and grow your mall by unlocking and opening more stores! Each store has its own development levels, unlocking new products and furnishings as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Strategic pricing and customer reactions</strong>: Set the right price for your products and watch how your customers react. If your prices are too high, they'll walk away, but if you find the right balance, your profits will soar!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Advertising revenue and vending machines</strong>: Set up billboards and place various vending machines throughout the mall. The more visitors you attract, the higher your advertising revenue and sales will be!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/mall_managergame.gif?t=1747400686\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dynamic quality index</strong>: Boost your mall's appeal with decorative elements like plants and benches to increase foot traffic and customer satisfaction. Every detail contributes to the success of your shopping center!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Staff management</strong>: Hire sales assistants, cleaners, and vending machine refillers! Upgrade your staff's abilities to make them more efficient and faster in handling their tasks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Comprehensive financial analysis</strong>: Monitor your mall\u2019s financial status with the central diagram. Review daily income and expenses to ensure you\u2019re making the best strategic decisions for growth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenging levels and activities</strong>: Complete a variety of tasks and reach new levels to unlock exciting new features. Open new stores, install more billboards, and upgrade the mall\u2019s infrastructure to keep your visitors coming back for more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">    <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/extras/mallmanagertable.gif?t=1747400686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why should you play Mall Manager Simulator?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mall Manager Simulator is a rich and engaging management game that challenges your strategic thinking. Step by step, you\u2019ll develop your mall, with every decision you make shaping the future of your shopping empire. Can you become the most successful mall manager and build the city's greatest shopping destination?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dive into the challenge and transform your mall into a shopping paradise! Download Mall Manager Simulator now and start your journey toward becoming the best mall manager in town!</p>","developers":["Krisztian Blaha","KINETIC MOBILE GAMES"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3092980/header.jpg?t=1747400686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257134004,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134004/movie480.mp4?t=1746121070","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134004/movie_max.mp4?t=1746121070"},"name":"Mall Manager Simulator Full Game","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257134004/8930cc2b7c91b4ddc99edb1de5f7b0849a871248/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746121070","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134004/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746121070","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257134004/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746121070"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257140580,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140580/movie480.mp4?t=1747400685","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257140580/movie_max.mp4?t=1747400685"},"na